### 1. Quick Debug Checklist
- [x] Are you running on an Ubuntu 18.04 node?
- [x] Are you running Kubernetes v1.13+?
- [x] Are you running Docker (>= 18.06) or CRIO (>= 1.13+)?

### 1. Issue or feature description

The operator is working, but the gpu-operator pod is currently writing about 1000-2000 message like these, per second.
It's all INFO level, so it doesn't seem to stem from an error.

It's causing things to break.

